# Voq, Torchbearer: "ChoH'a' — You may have Voq enter as a copy of a creature card in a graveyard, except he's a Klingon Spy in
# addition to his other types and has menace." Bot2's Entomb puts Llanowar Elves into Bot2's graveyard, so an opponent's
# graveyard is as available as your own (a choice, not a target, CR 608.2d). Voq enters as a copy of it: 1/1, with the Elf and
# Druid types and Klingon and Spy added, and menace (CR 614.1c, 707.9b). Bot2's deck lists the Elves past the opening seven so
# they are still in the library for Entomb.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Voq, Torchbearer
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Entomb
Forest x8
Llanowar Elves x3
Forest x7

